1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,031
Ethers come in two classes.

2
00:00:02,031 --> 00:00:08,984
A simple, or symmetrical, ether has the same group on both sides, like diethyl ether.

3
00:00:08,984 --> 00:00:15,182
A mixed, or unsymmetrical, ether has two different groups, like methoxyethane.

4
00:00:15,182 --> 00:00:22,747
If one group is an aryl ring, as in anisole, methoxybenzene, it is an aromatic ether.

